133.333%;"><img alt=3D"T3 made a splash at our Week 1 Event at home in Tomb=
all!=20

On the first day, we hosted Girls Get Together with @frc1477 and m.e.  FIRS=
T with @frc1477 and @eagle.robotics, as well as passed out our friendship b=
racelets around the pit.

On the second day of competition we loved having @231highvoltage in an alli=
ance again and were honored to work with Spicy Chihuahuas!

We are grateful to have received the gracious professionalism award, and ar=
e proud of our mentor, Mr. Gerren, for being a Woodie Flowers nominee!

Thank you to @tomballisd for hosting a spectacular event, and we look forwa=
rd to seeing everyone in Space City!

