" style=3D"padding-bottom: 133.333%;"><img alt=3D"Happy New Year from T3! B=
efore we start this competition season we want to take a deep dive into our=
 successful offseason!=20

All of our new members explored each subsystem and started learning how to =
prepare for upcoming competitions.

We also hosted a successful toy drive, sponsoring 256 children!

Our offseason ended with a mock kickoff to prepare all of our members for t=
he quickly approaching competition season.

Ultimately, T3 had an incredibly successful offseason and we can=E2=80=99t =
wait to see what the upcoming game is!
